{'symbol': 'TMO', 'date': '2022-08-01 08:30:00', 'title': 'THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC OPENS ONCOMINE CLINICAL RESEARCH GRANT CALL FOR SUBMISSIONS AND ANNOUNCES LATEST AWARDEES', 'text': 'CARLSBAD, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS PART OF ITS CONTINUED COMMITMENT TO EXPAND THE BENEFITS OF NEXT-GENERATION SEQUENCING (NGS), THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC IS NOW ACCEPTING SUBMISSIONS FOR THE FIFTH ROUND OF THE ONCOMINE CLINICAL RESEARCH GRANT PROGRAM. THE PROGRAM SUPPORTS CLINICAL AND TRANSLATIONAL RESEARCH THAT ADVANCES THE USE OF GENOMIC TESTING TO UNLOCK THE PROMISE OF PRECISION MEDICINE FOR MORE CANCER PATIENTS. THE PROGRAM AWARDS INDEPENDENT CLINICAL RESEARCH TEAMS WITH FINANCIAL SUPPORT'}